        "zh-CN": "依定义相等是等价关系"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "Definitional equality is an equivalence relation on the set of all legal expressions.",
          "zh-CN": "依定义相等是全体合法表达式上的等价关系。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Lambda.def.defeq",
