    {
      "id": "Logic.cxmp.nat-add-not-defeq",
      "package": "_unpackaged",
      "kind": "counterexample",
      "title": {
        "en": "Commutativity of Natural-Number Addition Is Not Definitional Equality",
        "zh-CN": "自然数加法交换律不是依定义相等"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "In the metatheory of untyped $\\lambda$-calculus, let $m,n$ be variables standing for natural-number expressions. The open expressions $\\mathsf{add}\\;m\\;n$ and $\\mathsf{add}\\;n\\;m$ are generally not definitionally equal. This concerns expressions, not closed expressions obtained by substituting concrete Church numerals; the latter both $\\beta$-reduce to the same Church numeral.",
          "zh-CN": "在无类型 $\\lambda$-演算的元理论中，令 $m,n$ 为表示自然数表达式的变量。开放表达式 $\\mathsf{add}\\;m\\;n$ 与 $\\mathsf{add}\\;n\\;m$ 一般不是依定义相等的。这讨论的是表达式，而不是代入具体丘奇数后得到的闭表达式；后两者都可通过 $\\beta$-归约得到同一个丘奇数。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Logic.subsec.propositional",
      "parent_node_ids": [
        "n_sub_prop"
      ],
      "after_entry_id": "Logic.def.iff",
      "graph_level": "entry",
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Type.cxmp.vector-index-not-defeq",
      "package": "TypeTheory",
      "kind": "counterexample",
      "title": {
        "en": "Commutativity of Vector Indices Is Not Definitional Equality",
        "zh-CN": "向量下标的交换律不是依定义相等"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "In CIC, for variable natural-number indices $m,n$, the types $\\operatorname{Vector}(m+n)$ and $\\operatorname{Vector}(n+m)$ are generally not definitionally equal. Commutativity of addition gives a propositional equality, so transporting or rewriting along that proof is required.",
          "zh-CN": "在 CIC 中，对于作为变量的自然数下标 $m,n$，类型 $\\operatorname{Vector}(m+n)$ 与 $\\operatorname{Vector}(n+m)$ 一般不是依定义相等的。加法交换律给出的是命题相等，因此需要沿该证明进行转运或改写。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Type.def.vector",
      "parent_node_ids": [
        "n_54"
      ],
      "after_entry_id": "Type.def.vector.recursor",
      "graph_level": "subentry",
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Type.def.W",
      "package": "TypeTheory",
      "kind": "definition",
      "title": {
        "en": "W-Type",
        "zh-CN": "W-类型"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "Given `A : Type` and `B : A → Type`, the W-type `W A B` is generated by `sup : (a : A) → (B a → W A B) → W A B`. Its elements are well-founded trees: `a` selects a node shape and `B a` indexes its child positions.",
          "zh-CN": "给定 `A : Type` 与 `B : A → Type`，W-类型 `W A B` 由 `sup : (a : A) → (B a → W A B) → W A B` 生成。它的元素是良基树：`a` 选择节点形状，`B a` 为该节点的子节点位置提供指标。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Type.subsec.inductive-types",
      "graph_level": "entry"
    },
    {
      "id": "Type.def.enum",
      "package": "TypeTheory",
      "kind": "definition",
      "title": {
        "en": "Enumeration Type",
        "zh-CN": "枚举类型"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "An enumeration type is an inductive type with finitely many nullary constructors. The example `Color` is generated by `red`, `green`, and `blue`.",
          "zh-CN": "枚举类型是仅含有限个零元构造子的归纳类型。例子 `Color` 由 `red`、`green` 与 `blue` 生成。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Type.subsec.inductive-types",
      "graph_level": "entry",
      "after_entry_id": "Type.def.W"
    },
    {
      "id": "Type.def.structure",
      "package": "TypeTheory",
      "kind": "definition",
      "title": {
        "en": "Structure Type",
        "zh-CN": "结构类型"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "A structure type packages named fields. Its constructor introduces all fields at once, while each field name generates a projection function. Later field types may depend on earlier projections.",
          "zh-CN": "结构类型将具名字段打包在一起。构造子一次引入全部字段，每个字段名则生成一个投影函数；后续字段的类型可以依赖先前字段的投影。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Type.subsec.structure",
      "graph_level": "entry"
    },
    {
      "id": "Type.def.structure.ctor.mk",
      "package": "TypeTheory",
      "kind": "definition",
      "title": {
        "en": "Structure Constructor",
        "zh-CN": "结构构造子"
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Type.def.structure",
      "graph_level": "subentry"
    },
    {
      "id": "Type.def.structure.projection.first",
      "package": "TypeTheory",
      "kind": "definition",
      "title": {
        "en": "First-Field Projection",
        "zh-CN": "第一字段投影"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "For a structure `S` with field `first : A`, the generated projection has type `S → A`.",
          "zh-CN": "对于含字段 `first : A` 的结构 `S`，自动生成的投影函数类型为 `S → A`。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Type.def.structure",
      "graph_level": "subentry",
      "after_entry_id": "Type.def.structure.ctor.mk"
    },
    {
      "id": "Type.def.structure.projection.dependent",
      "package": "TypeTheory",
      "kind": "definition",
      "title": {
        "en": "Dependent-Field Projection",
        "zh-CN": "依值字段投影"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "If a later field has type `B first`, its projection has dependent type `(s : S) → B s.first`.",
          "zh-CN": "若后续字段的类型是 `B first`，其投影函数具有依值类型 `(s : S) → B s.first`。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Type.def.structure",
      "graph_level": "subentry",
      "after_entry_id": "Type.def.structure.projection.first"
    },
    {
      "id": "Type.def.list",
      "package": "TypeTheory",
      "kind": "definition",
      "title": {
        "en": "List",
        "zh-CN": "列表"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "For `A : Type`, `List A` is generated by `nil : List A` and `cons : A → List A → List A`.",
          "zh-CN": "给定 `A : Type`，`List A` 由 `nil : List A` 与 `cons : A → List A → List A` 生成。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Type.subsec.inductive-types",
      "graph_level": "entry",
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Type.def.prod",
      "package": "TypeTheory",
      "kind": "definition",
      "title": {
        "en": "Product Type",
        "zh-CN": "积类型"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "For `A B : Type`, the product type `A × B` is generated by `pair : A → B → A × B`; its components are observed by the two projections.",
          "zh-CN": "给定 `A B : Type`，积类型 `A × B` 由 `pair : A → B → A × B` 生成，并由两个投影函数取得分量。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Type.subsec.inductive-types",
      "graph_level": "entry",
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Type.def.sum",
      "package": "TypeTheory",
      "kind": "definition",
      "title": {
        "en": "Sum Type",
        "zh-CN": "和类型"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "For `A B : Type`, the sum type `A ⊕ B` is generated by `inl : A → A ⊕ B` and `inr : B → A ⊕ B`.",
          "zh-CN": "给定 `A B : Type`，和类型 `A ⊕ B` 由 `inl : A → A ⊕ B` 与 `inr : B → A ⊕ B` 生成。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Type.subsec.inductive-types",
      "graph_level": "entry",
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Type.def.Sigma",
      "package": "TypeTheory",
      "kind": "definition",
      "title": {
        "en": "$\\Sigma$-Type",
        "zh-CN": "$\\Sigma$-类型"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "Given `A : Type` and `B : A → Type`, the Σ-type contains dependent pairs `(a, b)` with `a : A` and `b : B a`. Its second projection depends on the first.",
          "zh-CN": "给定 `A : Type` 与 `B : A → Type`，Σ-类型包含依值序对 `(a, b)`，其中 `a : A` 且 `b : B a`；第二投影的类型依赖第一投影。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Type.subsec.structure",
      "graph_level": "entry",
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Type.def.bin-tree",
      "package": "TypeTheory",
      "kind": "definition",
      "title": {
        "en": "Binary Tree",
        "zh-CN": "二叉树"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "A binary tree is generated by leaves and binary nodes whose two recursive arguments are subtrees.",
          "zh-CN": "二叉树由叶节点与二元节点生成；二元节点的两个递归参数都是子树。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Type.subsec.inductive-types",
      "graph_level": "entry",
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Type.def.vector",
      "package": "TypeTheory",
      "kind": "definition",
      "title": {
        "en": "Vector Type",
        "zh-CN": "向量类型"
      },
      "content": {
        "markdown": {
          "en": "For `A : Type`, `Vector A n` is an inductive family indexed by its length: `nil` has index zero and `cons` increases the index by one.",
          "zh-CN": "给定 `A : Type`，`Vector A n` 是以长度为指标的归纳族：`nil` 的指标为零，`cons` 将指标增加一。"
        }
      },
      "parent_entry_id": "Type.subsec.inductive-types",
      "graph_level": "entry",
      "existing": true
    }
